# .env.example -- the ONLY env file that is committed. Template: repo-conventions v1 (2026-10-28).
#
# Plinth reads NO environment variables (docs/04-architecture.md section 10).
# Keys and secrets used with the library (service signing keys, the redaction
# installation secret) are passed as function arguments by the consuming product,
# which keeps them in its own secret store. Nothing to copy or fill in here.
